        "html_content": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>20.10: Surgical Adhesive Tape</title>\n    <style>\n        /* Basic Reset & Global Styles */\n        :root {\n            --header-bg: #222;\n            --header-text: #fff;\n            --link-color: #007bff; /* A common blue for links */\n            --light-blue-bg: #e0f7fa; /* Light blue for info box background */\n            --light-blue-border: #00bcd4; /* Slightly darker blue for info box border */\n            --footer-bg: #f0f0f0;\n            --footer-text: #666;\n            --feedback-bg: #333;\n            --feedback-text: #fff;\n            --main-content-width: 960px; /* Estimated width based on image */\n            --text-color: #333;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            background-color: #fff; /* Ensure white background for main content */\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: var(--link-color);\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* Header */\n        .header {\n            background-color: var(--header-bg);\n            color: var(--header-text);\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            height: 50px; /* Fixed height for header */\n        }\n\n        .header-left {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .header-logo-square {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            background-color: #007bff; /* Blue color for the logo square */\n        }\n\n        .header-nav ul {\n            list-style: none;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav li a {\n            color: var(--header-text);\n            padding: 15px 0; /* Adjust padding to match header height */\n            display: block;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav li a:hover {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .dropdown-arrow {\n            margin-left: 5px;\n            font-size: 0.7em;\n            vertical-align: middle;\n        }\n\n        /* Main Content */\n        .main-content {\n            max-width: var(--main-content-width);\n            margin: 40px auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 2.2em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        .chapter-info {\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            color: #666;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .chapter-info a {\n            color: #007bff; /* Specific blue for this link */\n        }\n\n        .description-paragraph {\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n\n        .description-paragraph a {\n            color: #007bff;\n        }\n\n        .matching-items-link {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-left\">\n            <div class=\"header-logo-square\"></div>\n            <span>LibreTexts</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"header-nav\">\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Bookshelves</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Libraries</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Campus<span class=\"dropdown-arrow\">\u25bc</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n        <p class=\"chapter-info\">\n            <a href=\"#\">CHAPTER 20: BIOMATERIALS</a>\n        </p>\n        <h1>20.10: Surgical Adhesive Tape</h1>\n        <p class=\"description-paragraph\">\n            Surgical tape or medical tape is a type of pressure-sensitive adhesive tape used in medicine and first aid to hold a bandage or other dressing onto a wound. These tapes usually have a hypoallergenic adhesive which is designed to hold firmly onto skin, dressing materials, and underlying layers of tape, but to remove easily without damaging the skin. They are breathable, allowing air to reach the skin. Some breathable tapes such as <a href=\"#\">Kinesiology tape</a>, and other elastic bandages with adhesive are made of cotton.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"matching-items-link\">View Matching Items</a>\n    </main>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
